// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2323922985" "Find Mu Leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2589653109" "The Leader of this group of Mu had some interesting words for you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P656683896" "You defeated the Mu Leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4240942589" "I do not like the sound of any of this. I will not take this mutiny lightly. And if their threats of returning their goddess have any basis, we must act swiftly to stop them. The gateway to the beyond is a vital part of Operation: DESTINY, and DESTINY shall neither be denied nor interfered with."
// RandomFameString :
"P2822103295" "I think those weird floating Mu Mystics are up to something really bad."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3078739072" "Now that the treachery within the ranks of the Mu Mystics has come to light, the traitors have taken action. They have abducted Eukrisal, and gone underground. Though the traitor's numbers are smaller than I had feared, their abduction of Eukrisal and their aims still make them a significant threat. Worse, they have used their magic to cloak their location. This upsets me greatly, and may have dire consequences for Operation: DESTINY unless it is stopped. We must find those renegade mystics or this will be on both of our heads. I think a good place to start might be to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>question Magus Mu'Drakhan in the Nerva Archipelago. He holds a high rank among the Mu mystics of Arachnos, and is smart enough to know that he should tell anything he knows.</A> Take action once you have spoke with him."
// AcceptString :
"P510731631" "Get info from Mu'Drakhan"
// SendOffString :
"P364866494" "Once you have the information from Mu'Drakhan, act without delay. Free Eukrisal, and defeat the leaders of this rebellion."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3523782283" "Find out what Mu'Drakhan knows. He should be smart enough to talk."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P417898186" "Destroy {VillainName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1968517568" "Ah, {VillainName}. When I heard of the excessive enthusiasms of some Mu mystics had led them down a path to ruin, I knew that it would not be long before Sirocco sent you to speak with me. Now, while it is true that I am held in a high position amongst my people, I had nothing to do with this regrettable incident. Though I understand the traitors' longing for the return of our Goddess, as would any who have embraced their Mu ancestry, I am not so foolish as to get involved in their plan. However, I do know where they have gone to ground. I am also not so foolish to hide that information from you. I will tell you where to go."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P992026416" "Punish the Mu Traitors"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P324947761" "I knew I knew I could trust Mu'Drakhan to save his own skin the moment he might be implicated. Now, act on what he has told you and find those traitors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4269697258" "Down below the revelry of St. Martial, the traitors will meet their fate."

